WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:18.330
"I you to a meditation contest," said the Tiger Immortal.

2
00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.452
"Whoever can meditate the longest without moving is the winner."

3
00:00:23.993 --> 00:00:27.295
gulped. "I used to meditate a lot," he thought.

4
00:00:28.195 --> 00:00:29.176
I haven't done it lately.

5
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:31.701
I'm terrible at sitting still."

6
00:00:33.082 --> 00:00:34.603
Tang Monk stepped forward.

7
00:00:34.623 --> 00:00:36.624
"I accept your challenge."

8
00:00:37.725 --> 00:00:38.765
"Master, are you sure?"

9
00:00:39.065 --> 00:00:39.806
asked Wujing.

10
00:00:40.566 --> 00:00:41.567
Tang Monk nodded.

11
00:00:41.587 --> 00:00:44.228
"I've spent many years meditating.

12
00:00:45.089 --> 00:00:46.670
This contest will be easy for me."

13
00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.091
Tiger Immortal grinned.

14
00:00:49.111 --> 00:00:52.513
"This won't be an ordinary meditation contest.

15
00:00:53.414 --> 00:00:55.275
will float in the air and meditate.

16
00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:58.576
Can you do that?"

17
00:00:58.696 --> 00:01:00.357
Now the Tang Monk looked nervous.

18
00:01:01.317 --> 00:01:04.798
But before the monk could answer, Wukong clapped him on the back.

19
00:01:04.818 --> 00:01:09.759
"Of course the Tang Monk can float in the air," the monkey replied.

20
00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.640
he whispered into the monk's ear.

21
00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:14.401
"Don't worry, Master.

22
00:01:15.081 --> 00:01:15.841
just meditate.

23
00:01:16.101 --> 00:01:17.382
I'll handle everything else."

24
00:01:18.742 --> 00:01:20.022
"What are you babbling about?"

25
00:01:20.262 --> 00:01:21.523
snapped the Tiger Immortal.

26
00:01:22.283 --> 00:01:23.824
"Let's start the contest."

27
00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.143
The Tiger Immortal and the Tang Monk went in front of the crowd.

28
00:01:30.444 --> 00:01:33.827
They sat down with their legs crossed and their palms facing up.

29
00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.610
They closed their eyes and started meditating.

30
00:01:38.551 --> 00:01:42.394
After a moment the Tiger Immortal slowly floated up into the air.

31
00:01:44.776 --> 00:01:45.517
said Bajie.

32
00:01:45.537 --> 00:01:47.538
"Master can't do that.

33
00:01:47.819 --> 00:01:48.980
He'll lose the contest."

34
00:01:50.181 --> 00:01:51.562
worry," said Wukong.

35
00:01:51.582 --> 00:01:54.884
"He just needs some help from me."

36
00:01:54.964 --> 00:01:58.587
The monkey recited a spell and then blew toward the Tang Monk.

37
00:01:59.888 --> 00:02:01.509
monk lifted off the ground.

38
00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:04.531
His eyes remained closed.

39
00:02:05.412 --> 00:02:07.833
Soon he was floating next to the Tiger Immortal.

40
00:02:07.853 --> 00:02:13.758
"I think Master will win this contest," said Wujing.

41
00:02:13.778 --> 00:02:17.540
"I'm pretty good at meditating too," said Bajie.

42
00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:20.222
"I could have competed in this contest."

43
00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:25.466
smirked. "It would take a lot of magic to lift you, Bajie."

44
00:02:26.266 --> 00:02:27.307
The pig snorted.

45
00:02:31.409 --> 00:02:32.270
face is twitching!"

46
00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:33.751
said Wujing suddenly.

47
00:02:33.771 --> 00:02:37.473
"Uh-oh," said Bajie.

48
00:02:37.493 --> 00:02:39.194
"I wonder what's wrong."

49
00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:42.295
he has a headache," said Wujing.

50
00:02:43.076 --> 00:02:43.796
"This isn't good.

51
00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:46.958
If the monk moves at all, he will lose the contest."

52
00:02:48.099 --> 00:02:49.960
Wukong looked up at the Tang Monk.

53
00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.701
"I think he has an itch," said the monkey.

54
00:02:52.721 --> 00:02:53.781
"Wait here."

55
00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:57.442
Wukong became invisible and flew up to the monk.

56
00:02:59.303 --> 00:03:01.843
A flea was crawling on the monk's head.

57
00:03:01.863 --> 00:03:05.304
"Hmm," thought Wukong.

58
00:03:06.325 --> 00:03:08.325
would a flea be on the Tang Monk?

59
00:03:08.945 --> 00:03:09.986
He has no hair."

60
00:03:11.146 --> 00:03:12.346
The monkey bit his lip.

61
00:03:12.366 --> 00:03:16.087
"The Tiger Immortal must have used magic to put this flea here.

62
00:03:16.848 --> 00:03:18.048
That rotten cheater!"

63
00:03:19.552 --> 00:03:23.194
Wukong brushed the flea away and scratched the Tang Monk's head.

64
00:03:24.115 --> 00:03:26.076
The monk's face stopped twitching.

65
00:03:26.096 --> 00:03:31.399
"Now I'll teach the Tiger Immortal a lesson," thought Wukong.

66
00:03:32.179 --> 00:03:35.481
The monkey plucked one of his hairs and turned it into a centipede.

67
00:03:37.963 --> 00:03:40.785
He dropped the centipede onto the Tiger Immortal's head.

68
00:03:42.446 --> 00:03:46.368
The Tiger Immortal's ear twitched as the centipede crawled over it.

69
00:03:47.408 --> 00:03:49.870
Then the centipede crawled along his mouth.

70
00:03:50.991 --> 00:03:53.513
Tiger Immortal's lip curled slightly.

71
00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:55.074
His nose wrinkled.

72
00:03:56.034 --> 00:03:59.477
Next the centipede crawled on the Tiger Immortal's nose.

73
00:04:00.558 --> 00:04:02.059
The Tiger Immortal sniffed.

74
00:04:02.879 --> 00:04:04.941
And then "Ouch!"

75
00:04:05.161 --> 00:04:06.342
cried the Tiger Immortal.

76
00:04:06.362 --> 00:04:08.083
"Something bit me!"

77
00:04:10.365 --> 00:04:14.528
He lost his concentration and fell, hitting the ground with a puff of smoke.

78
00:04:16.044 --> 00:04:19.125
the smoke cleared, a dead tiger lay on the ground.

79
00:04:20.886 --> 00:04:21.987
The crowd gasped.

80
00:04:22.967 --> 00:04:25.468
Wukong and the Tang Monk came back down.

81
00:04:27.909 --> 00:04:29.009
crowd was silent.

82
00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.671
Daoists and Buddhists all stared at one another.

83
00:04:33.711 --> 00:04:35.112
The monkey cleared his throat.

84
00:04:35.132 --> 00:04:38.813
"The Tiger Immortal was just an evil tiger spirit.

85
00:04:39.854 --> 00:04:43.235
Now that he's gone, I want you Daoists to treat the Buddhists kindly.

86
00:04:46.482 --> 00:04:48.457
Everybody should live together peacefully."
